# "It deals 1 damage to you" and "create a Clue" go to the controller of the ability, who is the Inspector's controller as it
# died (CR 603.3a, 603.10a), not its owner. Bot2's Sudden Substitution exchanges its own Lightning Bolt (aimed at Bot1) for
# Bot1's Inspector: Bot2 now controls the Inspector, Bot1 the Bolt, and Bot1 aims it at the Inspector. It dies under Bot2's
# control: Bot2 takes 1 (19) and gets the Clue, while Bot1 (20) gets nothing and the card goes to Bot1's graveyard. (The
# ruling that a Clue so created is not investigating has no scenario: nothing in the engine watches for investigating.)

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Callous Inspector
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Lightning Bolt
Sudden Substitution
Island x13

